Build provenance
----------------

- Runtime assets were copied from NEXPRESS commit
  d321ad44f90829d7e54dfd4fa8afcfb3ef5e751a and adapted for the macOS App.
- HEIF encoding and decoding use macOS ImageIO. The elheif and heic-to
  browser assets are not included.
- scripts/build-metadata-lib.mjs hashes the embedded runtime assets for
  the invisible engine build identity.

- The NEXPRESS web UI, fonts, icons, Service Worker and JSZip are not bundled.
  The macOS UI is native SwiftUI; ZIP output uses system ditto.
